<title>USA: National Computer Systems expands board.</title>
<headline>National Computer Systems expands board.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Computer Systems Inc said on Monday it named Moses Joseph as a director, expanding the size of its board to nine members.</p>
<p>Joseph is president and chief executive officer of B-Tree Systems Inc.</p>
<p>National Computer is an information services company that provides software and systems for the collection, management and interpretation of data.</p>
<p>	   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
